<p>
Im under attack and my defences have failed!!

[ai7PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from the Knight of Wind</h2>
<p>
My friend I may not live to see the your glorious victory...Do not let my death slow you down, destroy these fools!

[ai8TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from Zarkhan the Great</h2>
<p>
I will not let you destroy my temple...defend yourself!

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
Your skills and strategies were not enough to win this battle.  Your allies defect to victor of this battle and your clan destroyed.  Truly a devastating loss.

